# Build context for the web image is this directory (the root .dockerignore
# excludes `web/` entirely and does not apply here).
#
# The secret patterns below are deliberately WIDER than the repo .gitignore rather
# than a copy of it: this file decides what reaches an image layer, and a layer is
# published. `.env*` replaces three named spellings, and the `**/` forms catch a
# nested match. Note the asymmetry: `.env*` carries no `**/`, so it covers the
# context root only. Measured: zero nested `.env` files in this tree today, so it is
# a coverage question rather than a live exposure.

# Installed and built output — the image builds both itself.
node_modules/
.next/
out/
.turbo/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Tests and their artefacts — not in the image. The Playwright specs live under
# `tests/e2e/`, so `tests/` already covers them; there is no top-level `e2e/`.
tests/
playwright-report/
test-results/
coverage/
.lighthouseci/
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.test.mjs
vitest.config.ts
playwright.config.ts

# Secrets and local-only files — must never reach a layer.
.env*
**/*.local.ts
**/*.local.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Tooling and docs.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.md
lighthouserc*
scripts/visual-verify.ts

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
